OL,3,GNEWSATeenage e-bike rider seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage e-bike rider has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries in a crash
OL,8,Fwith a car in Hull.
OL,10,FThe collision happened at about 10:20
OL,11,FBST on Sunday at the junction of Ings
OL,12,FRoad and Tween Dykes Road, Humberside
OL,13,FPolice said.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended and the
OL,16,Frider of the green e-bike, a
OL,17,F15-year-old boy, was taken to hospital
OL,18,Ffor treatment.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
